rce_after_ply":10,"anchor_node_id":"0:10","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment11:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment11","raw_text":"红方未进过河车先跳盘河马有急燥之嫌。","text":"红方未进过河车先跳盘河马有急燥之嫌。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":11,"anchor_node_id":"0:11","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment12:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment12","raw_text":"黑方进包封车就是针对红方盘河而设的。","text":"黑方进包封车就是针对红方盘河而设的。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":12,"anchor_node_id":"0:12","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment13:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment13","raw_text":"上一盘棋我们都是在介绍红方支士的变化，这一盘棋我们详细介绍红方不支士而平士角炮的变化。","text":"上一盘棋我们都是在介绍红方支士的变化，这一盘棋我们详细介绍红方不支士而平士角炮的变化。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":13,"anchor_node_id":"0:13","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment14:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment14","raw_text":"红方平士角炮，很明显要快速明九路车，并且封黑方的贴身车。对於平士角炮的应法，很奇怪，黑方还是支士应对。","text":"红方平士角炮，很明显要快速明九路车，并且封黑方的贴身车。对於平士角炮的应法，很奇怪，黑方还是支士应对。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":14,"anchor_node_id":"0:14","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment15:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment15","raw_text":"这一步棋红方如果明车抓包。","text":"这一步棋红方如果明车抓包。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":15,"anchor_node_id":"0:15","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment16:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment16","raw_text":"黑方平车保包。","text":"黑方平车保包。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":16,"anchor_node_id":"0:16","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment17:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment17","raw_text":"红方如果进车过河。","text":"红方如果进车过河。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":17,"anchor_node_id":"0:17","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment18:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment18","raw_text":"黑方平包兑车就可以了。","text":"黑方平包兑车就可以了。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":18,"anchor_node_id":"0:18","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment19:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment19","raw_text":"红方如果兑车，黑方很快就反先了。因为红方活跃的车兑掉了，只剩下一苹被封住的车，当然黑方反先。","text":"红方如果兑车，黑方很快就反先了。因为红方活跃的车兑掉了，只剩下一苹被封住的车，当然黑方反先。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":19,"anchor_node_id":"0:19","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_19:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_19","raw_text":"那麽红方如果不兑车，平车去卒压马。","text":"那麽红方如果不兑车，平车去卒压马。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":19,"anchor_node_id":"1:19","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_20:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_20","raw_text":"红方平车去卒时，黑方进车保马就好了，这时候红方的弱点就暴露出来了，因为红方的九路兵没有人防守，红方的盘河马没有地方跳，这些都是红方布局上的弱点。","text":"红方平车去卒时，黑方进车保马就好了，这时候红方的弱点就暴露出来了，因为红方的九路兵没有人防守，红方的盘河马没有地方跳，这些都是红方布局上的弱点。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":20,"anchor_node_id":"1:20","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment2_17:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment2_17","raw_text":"如果红方没有进车过河而进马去卒。","text":"如果红方没有进车过河而进马去卒。","source_line_id":"2","source_after_ply":17,"anchor_node_id":"2:17","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment2_18:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment2_18","raw_text":"被黑方进过河包，红方还是被反先了，因为黑方有平包射马的棋，或者出贴身车抓士角炮的棋。","text":"被黑方进过河包，红方还是被反先了，因为黑方有平包射马的棋，或者出贴身车抓士角炮的棋。","source_line_id":"2","source_after_ply":18,"anchor_node_id":"2:18","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment3_15:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment3_15","raw_text":"所以在这个局面红方明车不好，只好进马去卒。","text":"所以在这个局面红方明车不好，只好进马去卒。","source_line_id":"3","source_after_ply":15,"anchor_node_id":"3:15","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment3_16:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment3_16","raw_text":"黑方平包去兵反击。","text":"黑方平包去兵反击。","source_line_id":"3","source_after_ply":16,"anchor_node_id":"3:16","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment3_17:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment3_17","raw_text":"如果红方支士。","text":"如果红方支士。","source_line_id":"3","source_after_ply":17,"anchor_node_id":"3:17","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment3_18:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment3_18","raw_text":"黑方进车兑车，兑车之後轮由黑方下。","text":"黑方进车兑车，兑车之後轮由黑方下。","source_line_id":"3","source_after_ply":18,"anchor_node_id":"3:18","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment3_20:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment3_20","raw_text":"黑方车一平二，次一著有沉底包的攻势。","text":"黑方车一平二，次一著有沉底包的攻势。","source_line_id":"3","source_after_ply":20,"anchor_node_id":"3:20","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment3_22:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment3_22","raw_text":"当红方车九平八时，黑方进包过河，局面黑方简单反先。","text":"当红方车九平八时，黑方进包过河，局面黑方简单反先。","source_line_id":"3","source_after_ply":22,"anchor_node_id":"3:22","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment4_17:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment4_17","raw_text":"所以在这个局面红方不支士，毅然弃车，它的变化是怎麽样？进马去包而弃车是一个气魄。","text":"所以在这个局面红方不支士，毅然弃车，它的变化是怎麽样？进马去包而弃车是一个气魄。","source_line_id":"4","source_after_ply":17,"anchor_node_id":"4:17","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment4_19:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment4_19","raw_text":"弃车之後，再平车抓包采取主动攻击。","text":"弃车之後，再平车抓包采取主动攻击。","source_line_id":"4","source_after_ply":19,"anchor_node_id":"4:19","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment4_20:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment4_20","raw_text":"黑方这一步棋要平包，不要平车保包，因为黑方这一苹一路车保留著平贴身车的先手利才是正确的答案。","text":"黑方这一步棋要平包，不要平车保包，因为黑方这一苹一路车保留著平贴身车的先手利才是正确的答案。","source_line_id":"4","source_after_ply":20,"anchor_node_id":"4:20","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment4_21:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment4_21","raw_text":"红方进车抓双当然，那麽黑方为什麽要让红方有进车抓双的步子呢？","text":"红方进车抓双当然，那麽黑方为什麽要让红方有进车抓双的步子呢？","source_line_id":"4","source_after_ply":21,"anchor_node_id":"4:21","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment4_22:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment4_22","raw_text":"因为黑方也想弃子而采取攻势，包一进四是黑方的订单。","text":"因为黑方也想弃子而采取攻势，包一进四是黑方的订单。","source_line_id":"4","source_after_ply":22,"anchor_node_id":"4:22","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment4_23:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment4_23","raw_text":"到了这步田地红方平车去马是当然的。","text":"到了这步田地红方平车去马是当然的。","source_line_id":"4","source_after_ply":23,"anchor_node_id":"4:23","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment4_24:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment4_24","raw_text":"黑方享受先手平贴身车的权利。","text":"黑方享受先手平贴身车的权利。","source_line_id":"4","source_after_ply":24,"anchor_node_id":"4:24","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment4_25:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment4_25","raw_text":"红方支士不得已，但是支士之後就产生破绽了。","text":"红方支士不得已，但是支士之後就产生破绽了。","source_line_id":"4","source_after_ply":25,"anchor_node_id":"4:25","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment4_26:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment4_26","raw_text":"黑方贴身车进三牵制红方的七路马，次一著九路包平到七路，再得回一子。","text":"黑方贴身车进三牵制红方的七路马，次一著九路包平到七路，再得回一子。","source_line_id":"4","source_after_ply":26,"anchor_node_id":"4:26","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment4_27:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment4_27","raw_text":"红方没有步子可以下，先车七进一。","text":"红方没有步子可以下，先车七进一。","source_line_id":"4","source_after_ply":27,"anchor_node_id":"4:27","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment4_28:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment4_28","raw_text":"黑方不急著吃回一子，先平车去相。","text":"黑方不急著吃回一子，先平车去相。","source_line_id":"4","source_after_ply":28,"anchor_node_id":"4:28","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment4_29:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment4_29","raw_text":"如果红方飞相解消黑方沉底包的攻势。","text":"如果红方飞相解消黑方沉底包的攻势。","source_line_id":"4","source_after_ply":29,"anchor_node_id":"4:29","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment4_30:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment4_30","raw_text":"黑方退车去兵扩大优势。","text":"黑方退车去兵扩大优势。","source_line_id":"4","source_after_ply":30,"anchor_node_id":"4:30","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment4_32:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment4_32","raw_text":"当红方退马时，黑方平包牵制红方七路车马，局面到此黑方优势。||||当头炮布局未进二路过河车就跃盘河马，本身布局就是错误的，被黑方进包封车，局面就受制於黑方了。本布局就介绍到这边，谢谢！","text":"当红方退马时，黑方平包牵制红方七路车马，局面到此黑方优势。\n\n当头炮布局未进二路过河车就跃盘河马，本身布局就是错误的，被黑方进包封车，局面就受制於黑方了。本布局就介绍到这边，谢谢！","source_line_id":"4","source_after_ply":32,"anchor_node_id":"4:32","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false}],"issues":[],"metadata":{"DhtmlXQ_init":["500,350"],"DhtmlXQ_title":["12.屏风马左包封车应当头炮未进车左马盘河弃车局"],"DhtmlXQ_event":["第5节 破进七兵篇 第三章"],"DhtmlXQ_binit":["0919293949596979891777062646668600102030405060708012720323436383"]},"source_tag_count":43,"identical_tag_duplicates":0,"binit":"0919293949596979891777062646668600102030405060708012720323436383","side_to_move":"w","side_basis":"color of first source mover at binit square","standard_start":true,"summary":{"lines":5,"structured_branches":4,"line_statuses":{"legal":5},"source_move_records":48,"legal_move_records":48,"annotations":34,"annotation_statuses":{"attached":34}},"memberships":[{"book_id":"yl-book-65","category_id":"65","title":"第三章 屏风马破当头炮 第5节 破进七兵篇 12.屏风马左包封车应当头炮未进车左马盘河弃车局","catalogue_order":108,"directory_url":"https://m.xiangqiqipu.com/Category/List-65-5.html"}],"book_ids":["yl-book-65"]}}
